eady, as well as"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["People3",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["a few other reasons that I'm not going to tell"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["you.  I will say that I'm sure you four can do"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["these tasks for me and while they involve"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["danger I think you'll find ways to pull through."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["People3",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I need you to go through all of the doors in"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["the Cave of Dread and defeat all the robots"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["guarding the doors.  The robots had masters at"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["one time, and they killed those masters."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["People3",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["The cave is north of here."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":[""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I also want you to do something for the mayor"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["of the supercity of Yaster."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["People3",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["The Yaster archology has a crime problem with"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["an area of slums within, thanks to a gang boss"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["which I want you to track down and deal with"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["for the mayor.  If he fights, fight back."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["People3",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["If you fight back and end up killing him, well,"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["he gets what he deserves.  Just understand that"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["this sort of thing doesn't normally apply to"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["most people.  See if he'll talk, first."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["People3",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["About the third task, Gortish is in distress"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["from hostiles that have invaded and taken over"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["the town.  I want you kids to handle this one"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["too."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["People3",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["The plan to rescue what's left of Gortish is"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["two-fold: Eliminate all the bad guys, and also"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["investigate and get rid of the source of the"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["problem, whatever or wherever they come from."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["People3",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["When you're done with these tasks, find me"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["again in this castle, or wherever I am."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":[""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Okay?"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\P[1]: Yeah sure.  No problem, your highness."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["People3",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Feel free to stop by my castle to eat or spend"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["the night and rest, anytime.  You may do so"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["without asking me personally, just ask the"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["guards for anything you want."]},{"code":121,"indent":0,"parameters":[62,62,0]},{"code":121,"indent":0,"parameters":[58,58,0]},{"code":121,"indent":0,"parameters":[60,60,0]},{"code":123,"indent":0,"parameters":["A",0]},{"code":0,"indent":0,"parameters":[]}],"moveFrequency":1,"moveRoute":{"list":[{"code":0,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":true,"skippable":false,"wait":false},"moveSpeed":3,"moveType":0,"priorityType":1,"stepAnime":false,"through":false,"trigger":0,"walkAnime